      {
        "id": 17172,
        "title": "Operador de igualdad",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar comparaciones para verificar si el nombre de un estado del juego es igual o no igual a otro nombre de estado del juego.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar si una cadena es igual a otra cadena, podemos usar el <strong>operador de igualdad estricta</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si la cadena a la izquierda es igual a la cadena a la derecha, como en <code>\"PLAYING\" === \"PLAYING\"</code>, el resultado es <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"PLAYING\"</code> seguido de <code>===</code> y finalmente <code>\"PLAYING\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145341,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si la cadena a la izquierda no es igual a la cadena a la derecha, como en <code>\"PLAYING\" === \"GAME_OVER\"</code>, el resultado es <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;GAME_OVER&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code> seguido de <code>\"GAME_OVER\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145342,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>También podemos comparar variables que almacenan cadenas entre sí, como en <code>state1 === state2</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"state3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" state1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" state2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PAUSED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(state1 === state2);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>state1</code> seguido de <code>===</code> y finalmente <code>state2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145343,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué puede hacer el operador de igualdad, <code>===</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Comprueba si el nombre de un estado del juego es igual a otro nombre de estado del juego</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verifica si el nombre de un estado del juego es mayor que el nombre de otro estado del juego</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Comprueba si el nombre de un estado del juego es igual a otro nombre de estado del juego.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145344,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál de estos es el operador de igualdad estricta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145345,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra esto en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;BOSS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;BOS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145346,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál de estas comparaciones resulta en <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PAUSED\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PLAYING\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PAUSED\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si <code>playerChoice</code> es igual a <code>correctChoice</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerChoice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;attack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctChoice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;block&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerChoice === correctChoice);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena una cadena en <code>requiredState</code> para que la comparación sea <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requiredState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PAUSED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(currentState === requiredState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"PAUSED\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena una cadena en <code>item2</code> para que el resultado de la comparación sea <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;health potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;health potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mana potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDuplicate = item1 === item2;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isDuplicate);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"mana potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si <code>\"PLAYING\"</code> es igual a <code>\"GAME_OVER\"</code> codificando <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;GAME_OVER&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17173,
        "title": "Operador de desigualdad",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145351,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar si un valor de juego no es igual a otro valor, usamos el <strong>operador de desigualdad estricta</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145352,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si el valor a la izquierda no es igual al valor a la derecha, como en <code>\"sword\" !== \"shield\"</code>, el resultado es <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"sword\"</code> seguido de <code>!==</code> y finalmente <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si el valor de la izquierda es igual al valor de la derecha, como en <code>\"boss\" !== \"boss\"</code>, el resultado es <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para almacenar el resultado de una comparación en una variable, usamos el signo <code>=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelChanged = \" /><text value=\"&quot;level1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;level2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál de estos es <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"goblin\" !== \"dragon\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"dragon\" !== \"dragon\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"goblin\" !== \"dragon\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál de estos es el operador de desigualdad?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>!==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>===</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra esto en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué hace el operador de desigualdad, <code>!==</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verifica si un valor del juego no es igual a otro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verifica si un valor del juego es igual a otro valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verifica si un valor del juego no es igual a otro valor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica si <code>playerGuess</code> no es igual a <code>secretCode</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerGuess = \" /><text value=\"&quot;redKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" secretCode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blueKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerGuess !== secretCode);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena una cadena en <code>equippedSprite</code> para mostrar <code>false</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;enemy.png&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equippedSprite = \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equippedSprite !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"hero.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena una cadena en <code>nextState</code> para que el resultado de la comparación sea <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;menu&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nextState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateChanged = currentState !== nextState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(stateChanged);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"playing\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si <code>bossName</code> no es igual a <code>minionName</code> codificando <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minionName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bossName !== minionName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
